{% set sezioni = [{"t": "Data controller", "p": ["The data controller is <strong>[LAURA'S FULL NAME / BUSINESS NAME]</strong>, based in <strong>[ADDRESS]</strong>, VAT <strong>[VAT NUMBER]</strong>. For any request concerning personal data: <a class='underline' href='mailto:info@rottedincenso.it'>info@rottedincenso.it</a>."]}, {"t": "What data we process and why", "p": ["<strong>Contact form.</strong> The name, email, phone number, number of travellers and travel preferences you enter are used exclusively to answer your request and prepare the consultation (legal basis: pre-contractual measures at your request, art. 6.1.b GDPR). We keep this information for as long as needed to handle the request and in any case no longer than 24 months after the last contact.", "<strong>Email and WhatsApp.</strong> If you write to us directly, we process the data you provide in order to reply. WhatsApp contact happens only on your initiative: clicking the button opens the app, to which WhatsApp's own privacy policy applies.", "<strong>Technical data.</strong> The hosting infrastructure records technical logs (e.g. IP address) needed to serve and secure the website (legitimate interest, art. 6.1.f GDPR)."]}, {"t": "Who processes data on our behalf", "p": ["We rely on providers acting as data processors: <strong>Netlify</strong> (website hosting, USA, EU-US Data Privacy Framework participant), <strong>Web3Forms</strong> (delivery of form messages to our mailbox), <strong>Aruba S.p.A.</strong> (mailbox, Italy). We do not sell or share data with third parties for marketing purposes."]}, {"t": "No profiling", "p": ["This website uses no profiling, advertising or behavioural analytics tools. Fonts and all graphic resources are served directly from our own domain, with no third-party requests during navigation."]}, {"t": "Your rights", "p": ["You can exercise at any time the rights set out in articles 15-22 of the GDPR: access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability and objection, by writing to <a class='underline' href='mailto:info@rottedincenso.it'>info@rottedincenso.it</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Italian Data Protection Authority (www.garanteprivacy.it)."]}, {"t": "Updates", "p": ["Any changes to this notice will be published on this page with the date of update."]}] %}
